hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"16727","Ibn Abi Adiyy narrated to us, from Muhammad ibn Ishaq, from Sulayman ibn Suhaym, from his mother, the daughter of Abu al-Hakam al-Ghifari, she said: I heard the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) say: A man draws near Paradise until what is between him and it is a cubit, then he speaks a word and distances from it farther than Sanaa."
